# LLM providers

Only OpenAI-compatible and Anthropic-compatible HTTP. No vendor SDK in domain
logic. Use a JSON Schema both vendors accept, then Zod-validate again.
Numeric bounds belong in application code when Anthropic rejects schema keywords.
